---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Privacy Policy & Data Protection | Real BMI"
    description="Real BMI privacy and consent policy. Learn about client-side computing with no personal health data stored, GDPR & CCPA rights, and Google Consent Mode v2 implementation."
    canonicalURL="https://realbmicalculator.com/en/privacy-policy/"
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
      title="Privacy Policy"
      eyebrow="Your data, your privacy"
      description="Learn how Real BMI protects your input data and keeps all calculations private and secure."
      returnUrl="/en/"
      returnLabel="Home"
    >
      <div class="space-y-8 prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg font-medium opacity-90">
        
        <!-- Privacy at a Glance (Quick Summary Card) -->
        <div class="not-prose p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--card)] border border-[var(--border)] shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                Privacy at a Glance
              </h2>
              <p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)]">
                A quick summary of how Real BMI protects your personal privacy
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span>We do not store your BMI or health numbers</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span>Calculations happen locally in your browser</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span>No user account or registration required</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span>No biometric or health data is ever sold</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium sm:col-span-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span>You have 100% control over analytics and ad preferences</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Trust Proposition Callout -->
        <div class="not-prose p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--accent)]/5 border-l-4 border-[var(--accent)] text-[var(--foreground)] space-y-1">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase font-display font-bold tracking-wider text-[var(--accent)]">
            Our Core Privacy Standard
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold leading-relaxed">
            All calculations execute purely on the client-side within your browser.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
            Your height, weight, age, and waist numbers never leave your device and are never sent to remote servers or saved in databases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal text-[var(--foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          At <strong>Real BMI</strong>, we believe user privacy and personal health data security are fundamental rights. Our calculator suite is built from the ground up on a privacy-first architecture where your biological measurements remain exclusively under your control.
        </p>

        <!-- 1. Zero Health Data Storage -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            1. Zero Health Data Storage
          </h2>
          <p>
            We do not collect, intercept, store, or transmit your individual biometric measurements.
          </p>
          <p>
            When you enter your height, weight, age, waist circumference, or activity level, all mathematical formulas execute entirely inside your device's web browser using JavaScript.
          </p>
          <p>
            These numbers never leave your phone, tablet, or computer, and are never saved to cloud storage or persistent databases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Browser-Only Processing & Session Reset -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            2. Browser-Only Processing & Session Reset
          </h2>
          <p>
            Because computation occurs locally, your entered data exists only while you view the page.
          </p>
          <p>
            When you close the tab, refresh the page, or clear your browser cache, all entered numbers and calculated outcomes are instantly cleared from device memory.
          </p>
          <p>
            Real BMI requires no accounts, no logins, and links no scores to identifiable IP addresses.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Standard Technical Diagnostics -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            3. Standard Technical Diagnostics
          </h2>
          <p>
            Like standard web services, our web host generates routine server access logs containing non-personal technical diagnostic data.
          </p>
          <p>
            This includes browser user-agent strings, operating systems, and high-level geolocation (country/city level) to detect malicious automated traffic and keep server response times fast.
          </p>
          <p>
            These operational logs contain zero health metrics and are strictly separated from calculator tools.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Web Analytics & Advertising Disclosures -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            4. Web Analytics & Advertising Disclosures
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is supported by privacy-friendly digital advertising and aggregated analytics to keep all calculators free:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to our site or other websites.</li>
            <li><strong>Opt-Out of Personalized Ads:</strong> You can turn off personalized advertising anytime via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Consent Management:</strong> We implement Google Consent Mode v2. Non-essential cookies for analytics and ads only activate when you give permission through our Cookie Preferences popup.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Your Privacy Rights (GDPR & CCPA) -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            5. Your Privacy Rights (GDPR & CCPA)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Whether you reside in the European Union, California, or elsewhere, you possess clear rights over your data:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>No Sale of Data:</strong> Real BMI does not sell, rent, monetize, or trade personal health numbers to data brokers.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> Because all calculations execute locally and zero health records are kept, your information is deleted by default.</li>
            <li><strong>Preferences Control:</strong> You can update or revoke your cookie choices anytime using our interactive <a href="/en/cookie-policy/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Cookie Preferences</a> center.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Website Security & Encryption -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            6. Website Security & Encryption
          </h2>
          <p>
            Our website uses modern Transport Layer Security (TLS) encryption and strict security headers to keep your connection safe, private, and tamper-proof.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Pre-Publication Review & Public Privacy -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            7. Pre-Publication Review & Public Privacy
          </h2>
          <p>
            Before any calculator or guide is published, it undergoes rigorous editorial and privacy verification.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not host open forums, comment sections, or user profile directories where personal information could ever be exposed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Children's Privacy -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            8. Children's Privacy
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is designed for a general adult audience. We do not knowingly collect or request personal information from children under 13 (or under 16 in the European Union).
          </p>
          <p>
            Pediatric calculators (such as teen growth percentile charts) should always be used under the guidance of a parent, legal guardian, or healthcare provider.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Contact & Support -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            9. Contact & Support
          </h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about our privacy practices, browser calculation architecture, or cookie settings, please contact our team via our <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Contact &amp; Support Page</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
